Subject: [PATCH] lis3: Add support for new LIS3DC / HP3DC chip
User-Agent: SEMI/1.14.6 (Maruoka) FLIM/1.14.9 (=?UTF-8?B?R29qxY0=?=)
 APEL/10.7 Emacs/23.1 (x86_64-suse-linux-gnu) MULE/6.0 (HANACHIRUSATO)
